Package: ethtool
Version: 3.16-r0
Description: Display or change ethernet card settings
 A small utility for examining and tuning the settings of your ethernet-
 based network interfaces.
Section: console/network
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Poky <poky@yoctoproject.org>
License: GPLv2+
Architecture: cortexa9-vfp-neon
OE: ethtool
Homepage: http://www.kernel.org/pub/software/network/ethtool/
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.21)
